       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.       TREQABST.

      *C******************************************************************
      *C
      *C    THIS PROGRAM ABSTRACTS REQUISITION INFORMATION FROM THE
      *C    MCFPCS5700 FILE (REQUISITION NUMBERS ARE STORED HERE DURING
      *C    THE DAY'S PROCESSING FOR AKRON-BASED PLANTS ONLY AND SAP/R3
      *C    PLANTS) AND FOR REQUISITIONS DEIGNATED TO GO TO CORPORATE WRITES
      *C    937 TRANSACTIONS TO DDAILYTC TO BE PROCESSED AT CUTOFF. THESE
      *C    TRANSACTIONS ARE THEN READ BY A PROGRAM ON THE MAINFRAME AND
      *C    A FILE IS CREATED WHICH IS LOADED INTO THE CORPORATE
      *C    PURCHASING SYSTEM. IN THE CASE OF SAP/R3 REQS, THE DATA IS
      *C    SENT USING SAPCOMM TO THE UNIX MACHINE AND THE FILE IS
      *C    PROCESSED INTO SAP/R3 AT THE MAINFRAME.
      *C******************************************************************
      *
      *C* 11/15/1995      CA YODER
      *C*   ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE LITERAL VALUES TO FIELDS IN TC1 RECORD.
      *C*   CORPORATE PURCHASING NEEDED VALUES IN THESE FIELDS, SO VALUES
      *C*   FOR THE TECH CENTER WERE USED.  IF ANOTHER PLANT NEEDS TO
      *C*   UTILIZE THIS PROGRAM, ANOTHER METHOD WILL NEED TO BE WORKED
      *C*   OUT.
      *C*
      *C* SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C*   EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C*
      *C  11/7/97         JEFF BUNGO
      *C    ADDED LOGIC FOR DES MOINES LITERAL VALUES IN TC1 RECORD.
      *C
      *C  OCT 1999        JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO WRITE A FILE FOR SAP/R3 REQUISITIONS DATA
      *C    PROCESSING FOR MEDICINE HAT.
      *C
      *C  01/06/00        CA YODER
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS "RL" RECORDS IN THE MCORPREQ FILE
      *C    TO SEND RELEASES TO CORPORATE PURCHASING FROM AKRON.
      *C
      *C  03/05/01        JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED MBUYER AND MSTORERM SO THAT BUYER CODE AND
      *C    DISBURSEMENT INSTRUCTIONS CAN BE SENT FOR DES
      *C    MOINES CORPORATE CODES.
      *C
      *C  08/23/01        CA YODER
      *C    REMOVED KEN BARR'S NAME AND REPLACED IT WITH CLIFF OYER
      *C    FOR TECH CENTER REQS.
      *C
      *C  12/19/01       DAVE PLUM
      *C    REPLACED CLIFF OYER'S NAME WITH CHARLIE STUMP FOR THE
      *C    TECH CENTER'S REQUISITIONS.
      *C
      *C  05/04/2005     CA YODER    REQ #2005-56302
      *C    CHANGED NAME AND DEPARTMENT TO JEFF HUBBARD, DEPT 550A.
      *C
      ********************************************************************

